WEBVTT

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:15.915
On that cold night, I came to realize

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:20.895
that there's a place deeper down
that hurts even more than injuries

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:26.125
In this world painted with lies

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:30.735
where it's not clear what's true anymore

00:00:30.735 --> 00:00:33.635
I wanted to keep you safe

00:00:33.635 --> 00:00:40.775
The moment that
distortion and love overlapped,

00:00:40.775 --> 00:00:48.855
the wind embraced the
sadness that had closed in

00:00:48.855 --> 00:01:00.165
I'll never forget your sole voice
that continues to echo through the sky

00:01:00.165 --> 00:01:09.005
The prayer is going to melt
away and disappear, just like snow

00:01:09.005 --> 00:01:13.645
Today, I'll increase my speed again

00:01:13.645 --> 00:01:17.745
as I search for the reason for living

00:01:17.745 --> 00:01:29.145
even if I can't be a hero just yet

00:01:46.745 --> 00:01:50.045
I'm impressed you were able
to escape from that situation.

00:01:50.045 --> 00:01:55.055
If you'll come with us quietly,
no harm will come to you.

00:01:55.055 --> 00:01:58.355
Besides, you want to see
your brother, don't you?

00:02:04.265 --> 00:02:06.595
Apocalypse Knights?

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:11.065
That's Zwolf?

00:02:19.745 --> 00:02:21.575
Amanda Werner?

00:02:21.575 --> 00:02:22.875
Yes.

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:27.005
My name is Shido. Come.
The commander is waiting.

00:02:28.555 --> 00:02:33.955
This castle has served as Zwolf
headquarters for the last 800 years.

00:02:33.955 --> 00:02:37.025
800 years? That puts it in the Middle Ages!

00:02:37.025 --> 00:02:41.365
Yes. Though we were known
as the Knights Templar back then.

00:02:41.365 --> 00:02:47.975
Ever since, we bided our time
while hiding in the darkness of history.

00:02:47.975 --> 00:02:50.405
On the outside, we're a relic from the past,

00:02:50.405 --> 00:02:54.645
but on the inside is a facility filled
with cutting-edge scientific technology.

00:02:54.645 --> 00:02:59.605
Truly, this castle is the embodiment
of the Zwolf organization itself.

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:06.255
She has aptitude. She's improved
quite well in such a short amount of time.

00:03:07.255 --> 00:03:09.525
I see...

00:03:09.525 --> 00:03:13.435
She's just pushing herself too hard!
She's been at it for six hours straight!

00:03:13.435 --> 00:03:15.665
She's got some real guts.

00:03:15.665 --> 00:03:20.035
I assumed XAT was just a
bunch of public safety hooligans.

00:03:20.035 --> 00:03:25.245
Yes, they do deserve praise for doing
so well with such meager equipment.

00:03:25.245 --> 00:03:27.805
Even the fact that one of
them survived is a miracle.

00:03:30.285 --> 00:03:33.405
But she's still a flesh-and-blood human.

00:03:34.215 --> 00:03:36.755
The amount of lactic acid
in her muscles limits her.

00:03:36.755 --> 00:03:38.185
It won't be long now...

00:03:47.965 --> 00:03:49.625
Pod #6.

00:03:50.565 --> 00:03:54.525
Just take a break already. It's
too much for your body to handle.

00:04:02.275 --> 00:04:03.935
Oh?

00:04:04.815 --> 00:04:09.115
I'd be too ashamed to show my
face to the others if I give in this easily!

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:12.385
I need to get stronger! For Malek's sake, too!

00:04:14.495 --> 00:04:18.495
As you know, Pale Horse
nanomachines in the blood

00:04:18.495 --> 00:04:23.135
activate in response to the host's mental state.

00:04:23.135 --> 00:04:26.265
In particular, hatred, bloodlust,
and the impulse to destroy

00:04:26.265 --> 00:04:28.875
maximize the effects that the Pale Horses have.

00:04:28.875 --> 00:04:31.575
Why, Joseph?

00:04:31.575 --> 00:04:34.975
Why didn't you resist me out of hate?

00:04:34.975 --> 00:04:39.145
You have no reason to undergo such suffering!

00:04:39.145 --> 00:04:44.455
In that regard, Joseph Jobson seems
to be adept at controlling his emotions.

00:04:44.455 --> 00:04:47.455
That's probably how he was able to
maintain his self for such a long time

00:04:47.455 --> 00:04:49.555
instead of losing control and going berserk.

00:04:49.555 --> 00:04:53.295
But that is also his limit.

00:04:53.295 --> 00:04:54.895
Precisely.

00:04:54.895 --> 00:04:56.555
Yes.

00:04:58.135 --> 00:05:00.875
You're not like Xargin.

00:05:00.875 --> 00:05:05.875
The central aim of this enhancement
plan is to disrupt his mental control

00:05:05.875 --> 00:05:10.645
and draw out his latent abilities as
a Blassreiter to their maximum levels.

00:05:10.645 --> 00:05:16.745
If successful, his combat abilities
should rival those of Magwald Xargin.

00:05:17.785 --> 00:05:19.585
We'll begin now.

00:05:25.725 --> 00:05:30.805
No punishment can ever atone for my sins.

00:05:30.805 --> 00:05:35.275
But someday, Joseph, Xargin...

00:05:35.275 --> 00:05:44.235
I will end all the
suffering you've gone through!

00:05:45.445 --> 00:05:47.175
What is this place?!

00:05:57.725 --> 00:05:59.065
Chief?!

00:05:59.065 --> 00:06:01.995
My title here is "Commander."

00:06:01.995 --> 00:06:06.735
What's going on?! Weren't
you a member of Public Safety?!

00:06:06.735 --> 00:06:14.345
Mei-Fong and I were merely on loan to XAT.

00:06:14.345 --> 00:06:18.115
Then this Zwolf thing is
actually a government agency?

00:06:18.115 --> 00:06:23.585
No. We're simply a doctrine-based
religious organization.

00:06:23.585 --> 00:06:27.595
Though we have many weapons
producers and military contractors

00:06:27.595 --> 00:06:30.265
working under us now.

00:06:30.265 --> 00:06:31.395
What?!

00:06:31.395 --> 00:06:35.795
It's crazy for a private organization
to possess so much military might!

00:06:35.795 --> 00:06:38.635
There's no need for concern.

00:06:38.635 --> 00:06:44.745
Zwolf's founding far
predates this nation's history.

00:06:44.745 --> 00:06:49.545
Law only applies to what lies
within the framework of a country.

00:06:49.545 --> 00:06:52.345
Zwolf, however, lies firmly outside that.

00:06:53.915 --> 00:06:55.755
Unbelievable.

00:06:55.755 --> 00:07:00.085
A band of knights from the
Middle Ages in the 21st century...

00:07:00.085 --> 00:07:05.865
I don't blame you. Our existence
has always been carefully concealed.

00:07:05.865 --> 00:07:09.535
Zwolf has carried on its ardent wish over time

00:07:09.535 --> 00:07:12.405
by remaining in the back pages of history.

00:07:12.405 --> 00:07:18.875
However, the other day finally
marked the end of our long wait.

00:07:18.875 --> 00:07:20.535
Observe.

00:07:21.915 --> 00:07:23.745
What is this?!

00:07:23.745 --> 00:07:26.745
Amalgam infection of massive proportions

00:07:26.745 --> 00:07:30.215
has even spread to the
eastern district of Bitburger.

00:07:30.215 --> 00:07:34.295
There is nothing the army and police can do now.

00:07:34.295 --> 00:07:39.365
So the government officially
requested Zwolf to clean things up.

00:07:39.365 --> 00:07:47.995
We've now returned to the front
pages of history as a paramilitary firm.

00:07:50.975 --> 00:07:54.975
Charged particle cannon voltage normal.
All armaments show green.

00:07:54.975 --> 00:07:56.845
Bow-rider startup complete.

00:07:56.845 --> 00:08:01.755
Cybernetic linkage normal.
Sword-rider ready to go!

00:08:01.755 --> 00:08:07.225
Antigravity field is stable.
Scale-rider setup complete!

00:08:07.225 --> 00:08:11.625
Very good. Apocalypse
Knights! All units scramble!

00:08:23.375 --> 00:08:27.875
Apocalypse Knights docking
complete. Now raising docking bay.

00:08:27.875 --> 00:08:29.775
Catapult lock OK!

00:08:29.775 --> 00:08:31.915
Gate open. Standby OK!

00:08:31.915 --> 00:08:34.435
Landing port build-up!

00:08:37.825 --> 00:08:39.875
Apocalypse Knights, launch!

00:08:46.365 --> 00:08:49.265
Military has begun to retreat to closure points.

00:08:49.265 --> 00:08:53.925
What can just three of them
do against that many Demoniacs?!

00:08:55.175 --> 00:08:57.135
Just watch.

00:09:03.515 --> 00:09:07.415
This is bad. It really does
look like the end of the world.

00:09:07.415 --> 00:09:10.385
There appear to be ground
squads that haven't escaped yet.

00:09:10.385 --> 00:09:12.855
- The usual course of action?
- Yes.

00:09:16.625 --> 00:09:19.425
Assume everyone is
infected and exterminate them all!

00:09:19.425 --> 00:09:21.565
Apocalypse Knights! Operation commence!

00:09:21.565 --> 00:09:23.225
Roger!

00:09:27.635 --> 00:09:30.845
Charged particle cannon fired. Urban area hit.

00:09:30.845 --> 00:09:33.275
Current extermination at 18%.

00:09:41.255 --> 00:09:44.045
All units, switch to solo combat mode!

00:10:11.185 --> 00:10:14.115
75 seconds to estimated completion time.

00:10:14.115 --> 00:10:16.855
S-Such weapons exist?

00:10:16.855 --> 00:10:19.855
We have always conducted diligent research

00:10:19.855 --> 00:10:22.795
in anticipation of the inevitable holy war.

00:10:22.795 --> 00:10:26.795
Zwolf's scientific prowess is
always one generation ahead

00:10:26.795 --> 00:10:30.355
of the standard level of existing weaponry.

00:10:34.805 --> 00:10:38.375
Why... didn't you use them sooner?

00:10:38.375 --> 00:10:42.415
If you can defeat Amalgams so easily...

00:10:42.415 --> 00:10:45.285
...then why did you leave XAT to die?!

00:10:45.285 --> 00:10:47.975
Because we had no choice in the matter.

00:10:51.185 --> 00:10:58.295
Such a soft, languid society would
never have approved of our research.

00:10:58.295 --> 00:11:01.465
To operate the Apocalypse Knight superweapons,

00:11:01.465 --> 00:11:04.765
pilots need to be turned into cyborgs.

00:11:04.765 --> 00:11:07.435
In an environment in which human
experimentation was forbidden,

00:11:07.435 --> 00:11:12.775
producing superhumans like
them was nothing but armchair theory.

00:11:12.775 --> 00:11:16.375
Human experimentation? Don't tell me you?!

00:11:16.375 --> 00:11:20.485
It was you who used Joseph's
sister and turned Xargin into a monster?!

00:11:20.485 --> 00:11:24.785
Oh? Him and his big mouth...

00:11:24.785 --> 00:11:26.055
Well, no matter.

00:11:26.055 --> 00:11:31.295
Indeed, Sasha Jobson's research
was done under my supervision

00:11:31.295 --> 00:11:33.815
as part of Project Apocalypse.

00:11:35.495 --> 00:11:39.265
You're the cause of it all then, aren't you?

00:11:39.265 --> 00:11:44.805
With all noble purposes
come ordeals of equal proportion.

00:11:44.805 --> 00:11:48.775
At all times, we are being tested by God...

00:11:48.775 --> 00:11:50.605
...Amanda Werner.

00:11:57.255 --> 00:12:00.655
Apocalypse Knights, operation complete.

00:12:00.655 --> 00:12:04.525
That's all of them? What a joke.

00:12:04.525 --> 00:12:09.395
I would've preferred slightly tougher
enemies for data collection purposes.

00:12:09.395 --> 00:12:11.595
Okay. Let's return to base.

00:12:12.065 --> 00:12:13.725
Yes.

00:12:17.275 --> 00:12:21.745
It looks like Zwolf is finally
operating out in the open.

00:12:21.745 --> 00:12:23.765
Are you afraid, Beatrice?

00:12:25.315 --> 00:12:27.015
No, not in the least.

00:12:27.015 --> 00:12:33.625
Good. The love of those
who know fear is not whole.

00:12:33.625 --> 00:12:35.425
God is love.

00:12:35.425 --> 00:12:41.565
Those among love are
among Him, including He Himself.

00:12:41.565 --> 00:12:48.005
Which is why we can remain
bold even on Judgment Day.

00:12:48.005 --> 00:12:50.375
Yes, Xargin-sama...

00:13:03.355 --> 00:13:07.055
We've both changed beyond recognition, Joseph.

00:13:07.055 --> 00:13:09.625
Why, Sister?

00:13:09.625 --> 00:13:14.365
I'm just like you. I can't let
Xargin run free as he is now.

00:13:14.365 --> 00:13:17.165
He's become the enemy of all humankind.

00:13:17.165 --> 00:13:20.225
Not of humankind. Of Zwolf.

00:13:24.205 --> 00:13:28.045
Even after seeing what's happened to you, I...

00:13:28.045 --> 00:13:31.145
Is that why you've always fought all alone?

00:13:31.145 --> 00:13:34.155
I don't recall ever getting in Zwolf's way.

00:13:34.155 --> 00:13:36.455
You should've just left me alone.

00:13:36.455 --> 00:13:38.855
I'm afraid we couldn't.

00:13:38.855 --> 00:13:40.555
Joseph. You're the only one

00:13:40.555 --> 00:13:46.995
from the Pale Horse Section,
the Fourth Seal of Project Apocalypse,

00:13:46.995 --> 00:13:51.265
who's still in a human-controllable condition.

00:13:52.805 --> 00:13:57.005
Joseph. You'll never reach
Xargin's level on your own.

00:13:57.005 --> 00:14:01.605
But we can give you new strength.

00:14:05.545 --> 00:14:08.215
So you want me to be Zwolf's lapdog?

00:14:08.215 --> 00:14:13.885
That collar will fully
bring out your latent strength.

00:14:13.885 --> 00:14:17.525
It directly adjusts your mental state

00:14:17.525 --> 00:14:22.565
and creates the ideal
environment for Pale Horse activation.

00:14:22.565 --> 00:14:24.735
And that's how Zwolf does things?

00:14:24.735 --> 00:14:28.235
That's right. We won't force you, of course.

00:14:28.235 --> 00:14:32.875
But if you refuse, then forget about Xargin.

00:14:32.875 --> 00:14:37.745
This fight is between Zwolf and him.

00:14:37.745 --> 00:14:40.715
But if you insist on being involved,

00:14:40.715 --> 00:14:44.775
you'll have to do things Zwolf's way.

00:14:48.225 --> 00:14:53.465
All right. If it means I can
defeat Xargin, I have no objections.

00:14:53.465 --> 00:14:57.865
You're sure you won't have any regrets, Joseph?

00:14:57.865 --> 00:14:59.525
I'm sure.

00:15:00.105 --> 00:15:03.905
I'd like to request your services again.

00:15:03.905 --> 00:15:06.905
As a XAT member who survived
countless battles with Amalgams,

00:15:06.905 --> 00:15:09.515
you have rare experience.

00:15:09.515 --> 00:15:11.015
Amanda Werner.

00:15:11.015 --> 00:15:16.715
I would like you to help exterminate
Amalgams as a member of Zwolf.

00:15:16.715 --> 00:15:21.395
You want me to help you again,
after you lied to us all this time?

00:15:21.395 --> 00:15:25.295
Surely you must feel reluctant to sit and watch

00:15:25.295 --> 00:15:28.895
as further Amalgam-caused damage takes place.

00:15:28.895 --> 00:15:31.905
But at the present time,
we are the only ones capable

00:15:31.905 --> 00:15:35.735
of preparing weaponry to
resist the Amalgam threat.

00:15:35.735 --> 00:15:38.205
Plus...

00:15:38.205 --> 00:15:39.375
Malek!

00:15:39.375 --> 00:15:43.515
Victims like him will
certainly increase in number.

00:15:43.515 --> 00:15:46.115
Do you not want to prevent that?

00:15:46.115 --> 00:15:49.485
What are you... What are
you going to do with Malek?!

00:15:49.485 --> 00:15:55.955
Normally, Amalgams captured alive
are treated as rare research samples.

00:15:55.955 --> 00:15:59.095
But we are not heartless.

00:15:59.095 --> 00:16:03.395
We would never experiment
on relatives of our collaborators.

00:16:03.395 --> 00:16:07.105
I intend to exhaust all avenues of treatment.

00:16:07.105 --> 00:16:11.645
I see. So that's how it is...

00:16:11.645 --> 00:16:15.595
Fine. But on one condition.

00:16:16.645 --> 00:16:20.315
I'm not going to join your group.

00:16:20.315 --> 00:16:24.985
Instead, I'll assist you as the
last remaining member of XAT,

00:16:24.985 --> 00:16:30.155
while wearing this uniform and the XAT emblem!

00:16:30.155 --> 00:16:31.495
Very well.

00:16:31.495 --> 00:16:33.185
Do as you wish.

00:16:38.905 --> 00:16:40.305
I think it's a bad idea.

00:16:40.305 --> 00:16:41.135
Why?

00:16:41.135 --> 00:16:44.445
Zwolf will resort to
anything to achieve what it wants.

00:16:44.445 --> 00:16:45.775
Even at the expense of others.

00:16:45.775 --> 00:16:49.045
You shouldn't get deeply
involved with this organization.

00:16:49.045 --> 00:16:51.815
You won't be able to turn back.

00:16:51.815 --> 00:16:54.855
I don't care. I can...!

00:16:54.855 --> 00:16:57.515
Malek doesn't want that!

00:16:57.515 --> 00:17:00.785
Your feelings of guilt are yours alone.

00:17:00.785 --> 00:17:05.795
It would be utterly wrong for the
most important person to Malek to die

00:17:05.795 --> 00:17:09.535
while trying to make things up to him.

00:17:09.535 --> 00:17:13.465
You're his one and only sister.

00:17:13.465 --> 00:17:16.105
Then what about you?

00:17:16.105 --> 00:17:18.675
You're staying here for Sasha's sake!

00:17:18.675 --> 00:17:20.975
What are they trying to use you for?!

00:17:41.595 --> 00:17:45.165
The names of your dead comrades?

00:17:45.165 --> 00:17:49.005
Almost seems like a coffin. Are
you in that much of a hurry to die?

00:17:49.005 --> 00:17:52.445
Do you resent the fact that only you survived?

00:17:52.445 --> 00:17:55.075
It's none of your business.

00:17:55.075 --> 00:17:59.915
It is a problem, though. Fighting
alongside someone with a death wish...

00:18:03.385 --> 00:18:06.475
Especially one who's such a spitfire...

00:18:07.625 --> 00:18:09.425
Do you have something against me?!

00:18:09.425 --> 00:18:15.235
Not really. I just want to see your resolve.

00:18:15.235 --> 00:18:16.665
Come at me!

00:18:16.665 --> 00:18:19.365
Don't blame me if you end up regretting it!

00:18:24.775 --> 00:18:29.215
What a disconcerting lot you new people are.

00:18:29.215 --> 00:18:31.415
A XAT hanger-on

00:18:31.415 --> 00:18:35.655
and a rabid stray dog that's
stooped to being his sister's pet...

00:18:35.655 --> 00:18:38.455
Who knows if you're actually even usable...

00:18:38.455 --> 00:18:42.955
And what would you know?!

00:18:42.955 --> 00:18:44.945
Are you the same?

00:18:46.565 --> 00:18:51.635
You think you can eventually save
your brother by helping Zwolf, don't you?

00:18:51.635 --> 00:18:58.705
Honestly, now. You
older sisters all think alike.

00:18:58.705 --> 00:19:01.235
Mind your own business!

00:19:05.815 --> 00:19:07.645
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:19:09.015 --> 00:19:14.285
It was your fallen
comrades' lives that let you live.

00:19:14.285 --> 00:19:17.125
I'm simply telling you not to waste that.

00:19:22.395 --> 00:19:26.265
Don't mind us. We're simply
doing some mid-training sparring.

00:19:29.105 --> 00:19:33.565
The battlefields ahead will not be
easy enough to survive on your own.

00:19:35.215 --> 00:19:41.305
Consult your inner self to decide
who is friend and who is the real foe.

00:19:45.125 --> 00:19:47.125
"Bond"

00:19:47.125 --> 00:19:48.625
"Bond"
What is this?

00:19:48.625 --> 00:19:49.025
What is this?

00:19:49.025 --> 00:19:53.725
It means that even when far apart,
your hearts are still connected.

00:19:53.725 --> 00:19:58.235
Spirits reside in the words of my homeland.

00:19:58.235 --> 00:20:04.765
This character should connect
you with the names written here.

00:20:23.825 --> 00:20:27.855
I'll never give up on you guys.

00:20:29.465 --> 00:20:31.895
I can't give up on you.

00:20:34.635 --> 00:20:38.345
Now wake!

00:20:38.345 --> 00:20:40.675
Return to me!

00:20:48.455 --> 00:20:49.915
I see...

00:20:49.915 --> 00:20:55.655
So that's how far you'll go to resist me...

00:21:54.145 --> 00:22:05.265
I dreamed of that day we chased shooting stars

00:22:05.265 --> 00:22:15.675
What we had kept safe disappeared like sand

00:22:15.675 --> 00:22:19.745
Just another illusion

00:22:19.745 --> 00:22:28.845
Asleep, inside memories

00:22:30.085 --> 00:22:32.385
Wish for the stars

00:22:32.385 --> 00:22:40.925
Holding countless wishes with both hands

00:22:40.925 --> 00:22:43.495
A wish for the stars

00:22:43.495 --> 00:22:51.445
Quietly by your side, as you sleep

00:22:51.445 --> 00:22:57.075
Yes, right next to you

00:22:57.075 --> 00:23:03.055
Holding countless wishes

00:23:03.055 --> 00:23:08.815
Yes, right beside you

00:23:12.865 --> 00:23:17.295
He wished to protect.
He swore to fight and survive.

00:23:17.295 --> 00:23:20.805
Those memories are what spur him on,

00:23:20.805 --> 00:23:23.935
though he doesn't realize the presence of fate.

00:23:23.935 --> 00:23:27.275
Episode 16: "Reunion."

00:23:27.275 --> 00:23:31.405
Another demon that howls
out of anger and sadness is born.
